---

<BaseLayout>
  <div class="container">
    <section class="page__hero" aria-labelledby="page-heading">
      <h1 id="page-heading" class="page__heading">Installations</h1>
      <picture class="page__hero-img">
        <source srcset={installationsImage.src} media="(min-width: 1200px)" />
        <source srcset={installationsImage.src} media="(min-width: 600px)" />
        <img src={installationsImage.src} alt="Installations Image" />
      </picture>
      <p>
        Switching to solar energy is one of the smartest long-term investments
        for homes and businesses in Cyprus. With abundant sunshine throughout
        the year, solar power offers an efficient and sustainable way to reduce
        electricity costs while increasing energy independence. At Solar360
        Energy, we provide professional solar panel installation services
        tailored to your property, energy needs, and budget.
      </p>
      <p>
        From initial consultation and system design to installation and final
        setup, our team delivers reliable solar solutions built for long-term
        performance. Using high-quality equipment and industry-approved
        installation methods, we help customers across Cyprus maximise energy
        savings and make the most of the island’s natural solar potential.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section class="page__main"></section>
    <FaqAccordion items={faqItems} />
    <div class="cta__transition">
      <p>Ready to start saving with solar energy?</p>
    </div>
    <Cta />
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
